<title>FRANCE: Rouen Nov 1-6 grain exports at 181,624 tonnes.</title>
<headline>Rouen Nov 1-6 grain exports at 181,624 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain exports from Rouen reached 181,624 tonnes between November 1 and November 6, French port officials said on Tuesday</p>
<p>Grain exports totalled 336,000 tonnes in the whole of November 1995.</p>
<p>The 181,624 tonne total included 123,231 tonnes of wheat and 58,393 of barley.</p>
<p>Officials gave the following breakdown by destination (in tonnes)</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>    West Africa			4,200</p>
<p>    Egypt			     38,076</p>
<p>    Britain			    3,250</p>
<p>    Italy			     60,950</p>
<p>    Morocco			   13,750</p>
<p>    Poland			     3,005</p>
<p>BARLEY</p>
<p>    Saudi Arabia		    55,000</p>
<p>    Italy				3,393</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
